  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan School Expansion Project (JSEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce overcrowding in public schools, improve the quality of learning environment, increase access to public kindergartens, and provide better opportunities for youth and encourage teamwork, creative thinking and involvement in community work by establishing facilities for sports and other activities inside public schools.</narrative>
  </description>
